1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:03,810
[Episode 11]

2
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:05,250
Mister.

3
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:12,250
I'll save him.

4
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:16,900
I'll save Yun.

5
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,210
Mister.

6
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:20,570
So don't cry.

7
00:00:20,570 --> 00:00:24,670
I can't stand watching you cry.

8
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:29,070
You look as ugly as Shrek when you cry.

9
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:38,380
I'll give my heart to Yun, okay?

10
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,690
Mister.

11
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:46,230
I'll give my heart to Yun,

12
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:50,220
so will you be with me?

13
00:00:56,090 --> 00:01:02,210
Will you just stay with me while I'm still alive?

14
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:33,790
Did you think about it?

15
00:01:34,780 --> 00:01:38,880
What's there to think about? Let's do that. Okay?

16
00:01:39,510 --> 00:01:46,230
It's good for you, me, Yun, and Yun's mom.

17
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:51,190
It's a fantastic idea in my opinion.

18
00:01:51,190 --> 00:01:52,540
Bastard...

19
00:01:56,050 --> 00:01:58,470
You know how to cuss, Blockhead?

20
00:01:58,470 --> 00:01:59,930
You bastard...

21
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:04,840
Fine, take it out! Give your heart to him!

22
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,870
Take it out!

23
00:02:16,660 --> 00:02:19,940
Not now. I'll do it later.

24
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:25,670
I want to have good times with you and have fun.

25
00:02:25,670 --> 00:02:29,810
Don't I get anything in return?
I'll give it to him later.

26
00:02:36,460 --> 00:02:38,960
How can you stoop that low?

27
00:02:40,290 --> 00:02:42,760
Death is not a joke.

28
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:45,240
Go to hell, you bastard.

29
00:03:15,410 --> 00:03:16,850
Are you okay?

30
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:20,820
Hey! Hey, are you okay?

31
00:03:20,820 --> 00:03:22,190
Go away...

32
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:25,450
Hey, are you okay?

33
00:03:25,450 --> 00:03:28,450
Get your hands off me!

34
00:03:43,260 --> 00:03:47,870
I'll give my heart to Yun,

35
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:52,200
so will you be with me?

36
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:59,490
Will you just stay with me while I'm still alive?

37
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:15,650
Just save Yun. Save him.

38
00:04:15,650 --> 00:04:20,220
Yun, my Yun! If you could just save my Yun!

39
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:37,220
What did I do to deserve this?

40
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:42,490
What did I do wrong?

41
00:04:46,930 --> 00:04:52,800
I've donated three or four times more than others...

42
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:56,660
I'm even anonymously helping 12 families!

43
00:05:00,420 --> 00:05:04,610
But he's always cruel to me... Always!

44
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:10,600
Do you want to go all the way?

45
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:14,590
Do you really want to see how cruel
you can be to me?

46
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:19,700
Ma'am!

47
00:05:46,990 --> 00:05:50,240
Didn't you hear me before?

48
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:55,060
Didn't you hear from Mr. Kang to hire a new manager?

49
00:05:55,060 --> 00:05:56,740
Please go inside, ma'am.

50
00:05:56,740 --> 00:06:00,570
Why are you ignoring me?
Do you think what I say is a joke?

51
00:06:02,010 --> 00:06:04,400
Mr. Cha is doing a good job.

52
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:06,540
He's sincere, reliable, and smart...

53
00:06:06,540 --> 00:06:09,690
I get so furious just looking at him.

54
00:06:09,690 --> 00:06:14,640
If he had been there for Yun,
none of this would've ever happened.

55
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:16,480
Stop being stubborn and let's go inside.

56
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:18,560
Why are you keep blaming Mr. Cha?

57
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:21,570
I didn't like him from the beginning. I didn't.

58
00:06:21,570 --> 00:06:23,980
I really didn't like him at all.

59
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:25,470
Open the door.

60
00:06:31,470 --> 00:06:33,590
Find a replacement immediately.

61
00:06:33,590 --> 00:06:38,330
Seeing his face over and over is just torturous.

62
00:06:38,330 --> 00:06:39,900
I can't take it.

63
00:06:42,740 --> 00:06:43,990
Eunchae.

64
00:06:46,010 --> 00:06:47,400
Eunchae!

65
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:48,740
Ma'am!

66
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,870
Eunchae.

67
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:56,420
I'm so thankful to you, Eunchae.

68
00:06:56,420 --> 00:06:57,790
Come here.

69
00:07:00,450 --> 00:07:05,230
I'll fix up Yun for sure, Eunchae. Whatever it takes.

70
00:07:05,230 --> 00:07:09,840
I'll make sure Yun will be healthy again, Eunchae.

71
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:16,890
So don't go anywhere and stay next to my Yun.

72
00:07:16,890 --> 00:07:24,510
I'm so sorry, but please stay beside
my Yun, okay?

73
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:49,850
Mr. Cha.

74
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:56,300
Don't get mad over what Yun's mom said.

75
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:58,990
It's because she's gotten more sensitive.

76
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:01,000
Yes.

77
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:06,720
And... Start looking for some other job.

78
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:10,320
I'm sorry she blamed you,

79
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:18,100
but it's better for you and Yun's mom
if you give up the job now.

80
00:08:20,620 --> 00:08:22,880
I'm sorry.

81
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:27,520
I'll ask Mr. Kang to be generous
with your final paycheck.

82
00:08:37,230 --> 00:08:40,530
Is your sister doing well?

83
00:08:40,530 --> 00:08:41,750
Yes.

84
00:09:12,820 --> 00:09:16,770
I'll stay here. You should go home and get some rest.

85
00:09:16,770 --> 00:09:19,530
You should have gone with your dad earlier.

86
00:09:19,530 --> 00:09:22,180
I can stay here.

87
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:37,510
I'm worried that you'll get sick because of Yun.

88
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:41,960
Look at your face. It's gotten all rough.

89
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:44,120
But Yun will be looking for me.

90
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:47,270
I'll take care of it. Just go home.

91
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:52,230
- Okay, I'll go home then. Take care.
- Okay.

92
00:09:52,230 --> 00:09:53,500
Goodbye.

93
00:11:24,430 --> 00:11:25,790
Your fare.

94
00:11:27,930 --> 00:11:32,670
- Don't you have any smaller bill?
- No, keep the change.

95
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:12,270
[I'm not kidding]

96
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:28,550
I'm not kidding.

97
00:12:28,550 --> 00:12:31,700
Why would I joke about death?

98
00:12:33,490 --> 00:12:37,090
Maximum three months. Minimum...

99
00:12:39,050 --> 00:12:41,190
How long would that be?

100
00:12:41,190 --> 00:12:43,530
Should have asked the doctor that.

101
00:12:49,290 --> 00:12:53,840
I'll be dead around then.

102
00:12:54,730 --> 00:13:00,690
If I do one good thing before I die,
maybe I won't go to hell.

103
00:13:00,690 --> 00:13:05,190
And it will be good for you, Yun, and Yun's mom.

104
00:13:06,510 --> 00:13:08,520
Don't you think it's a good deal?

105
00:13:16,790 --> 00:13:20,770
I've even checked with the doctor.

106
00:13:20,770 --> 00:13:26,750
My heart is perfect for Yun's transplant, luckily.

107
00:13:26,750 --> 00:13:28,310
Wait for me, Blockhead!

108
00:13:30,100 --> 00:13:31,500
Blockhead!

109
00:13:32,710 --> 00:13:34,460
Blockhead!

110
00:13:36,870 --> 00:13:40,760
If you don't want me to. I will never touch you.

111
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:43,360
Not even your hair.

112
00:13:44,450 --> 00:13:47,170
Okay, that's a lie.

113
00:13:47,170 --> 00:13:49,110
I might still kiss you.

114
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:55,560
But if you really don't want to,
then I won't do that, either.

115
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:57,560
I'll just look at you.

116
00:13:57,560 --> 00:14:02,130
I'll just look at you.
Not hold your hand and not kiss you.

117
00:14:02,130 --> 00:14:05,730
Come be with me. Come be with me, Blockhead.

118
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:13,790
I didn't hear you before.
Can you tell me again?

119
00:14:14,630 --> 00:14:16,680
When are you dying, Mister?

120
00:14:19,040 --> 00:14:25,730
Maximum three months. Minimum...

121
00:14:25,730 --> 00:14:27,300
Didn't ask.

122
00:14:27,990 --> 00:14:30,340
You're definitely going to die, right, Mister?

123
00:14:35,510 --> 00:14:36,700
Yeah.

124
00:14:37,940 --> 00:14:41,420
Okay. I'll be with you.

125
00:14:42,370 --> 00:14:46,790
I'd do anything to save Yun.

126
00:14:46,790 --> 00:14:49,640
With every fiber of my being.

127
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:52,540
I'd even sleep with you.

128
00:14:52,540 --> 00:14:55,510
Just make sure you really die.

129
00:14:55,510 --> 00:15:00,110
Die for sure and save Yun. Keep your promise.

130
00:15:21,780 --> 00:15:23,790
[Unlucky star Audrey]

131
00:15:23,790 --> 00:15:25,800
[Written by the twins she abandoned:
Cha Muhyeok and Yun Seo-kyeong]

132
00:15:58,820 --> 00:16:00,930
Who are you?

133
00:16:02,460 --> 00:16:04,830
Death is not a joke.

134
00:16:04,830 --> 00:16:07,200
Go to hell, you bastard.

135
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:11,260
I want to take Muhyeok's hand.

136
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:15,810
You don't need me.

137
00:16:16,980 --> 00:16:24,570
You've always been fine without me.
You'll be fine without me.

138
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:38,980
So when a thug grabs you like this...

139
00:16:38,980 --> 00:16:44,570
And says, "Hey, wanna mess around with me?"

140
00:16:44,570 --> 00:16:50,410
Then twist his wrist like this,
and kick him where it hurts!

141
00:16:50,410 --> 00:16:53,560
Then even the biggest guy
wouldn't be able to do anything.

142
00:16:54,230 --> 00:16:55,300
Try it.

143
00:16:57,380 --> 00:17:00,010
Twist it like this? Like this?

144
00:17:00,010 --> 00:17:02,720
Not like that.

145
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:07,130
Twist with all your strength,
as if your life depends on it.

146
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:10,710
I don't wanna do it. I can't do it.

147
00:17:10,710 --> 00:17:15,710
What if the thugs come again?
Are you gonna let them do whatever?

148
00:17:15,710 --> 00:17:18,540
You can beat them up.

149
00:17:18,540 --> 00:17:20,650
You can beat them up.

150
00:17:20,650 --> 00:17:24,360
Thugs around here are so afraid of you...

151
00:17:24,360 --> 00:17:27,450
I started a rumor
that you are a very scary thug yourself.

152
00:17:27,450 --> 00:17:31,680
Yeah, Uncle is the scariest thug of all.

153
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,200
Right, Galchi?

154
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:35,710
Don't worry... As long as you're around...

155
00:17:35,710 --> 00:17:39,040
They won't touch my mom. Don't worry.

156
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:40,780
Don't worry.

157
00:17:40,780 --> 00:17:42,490
What if I'm not around?

158
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:46,310
What are you going to do if I'm not around?

159
00:17:46,310 --> 00:17:48,780
You said you wouldn't go to Australia.

160
00:17:48,780 --> 00:17:51,650
You said you will live with us for a long, long time.

161
00:17:53,970 --> 00:17:57,480
How can I live with you for a long, long time?

162
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:59,550
I have my own life to live.

163
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:02,950
You should work out.

164
00:18:02,950 --> 00:18:06,480
You have to protect your mom when I'm not around.

165
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:12,220
Let's do it again. What did I tell you to do?

166
00:18:13,730 --> 00:18:15,910
What are you doing? Show me what you would do!

167
00:18:18,580 --> 00:18:19,800
Do it.

168
00:18:20,551 --> 00:18:22,467
Geez.

169
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:41,030
Are you going to die for sure, Mister?

170
00:18:41,030 --> 00:18:42,230
Yeah.

171
00:18:42,230 --> 00:18:45,730
Okay. I'll be with you.

172
00:18:46,570 --> 00:18:50,990
I'd do anything to save Yun.

173
00:18:50,990 --> 00:18:53,840
With every fiber of my being.

174
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:55,960
I'd even sleep with you.

175
00:18:58,700 --> 00:19:01,120
Just make sure you really die.

176
00:19:01,120 --> 00:19:05,820
Die for sure and save Yun. Keep your promise.

177
00:19:09,710 --> 00:19:14,980
This is Ogalpi tea with shiitake mushroom honey.

178
00:19:14,980 --> 00:19:18,470
I heard it was good for the heart,
so stayed up all night making it.

179
00:19:18,470 --> 00:19:20,870
Give it to Yun.

180
00:19:20,870 --> 00:19:22,590
Thank you, Mom.

181
00:19:24,170 --> 00:19:26,630
But Eunchae...

182
00:19:26,630 --> 00:19:31,550
I'm not sure if it's okay to keep
sending you to Yun like this.

183
00:19:31,550 --> 00:19:32,790
Why not?

184
00:19:33,290 --> 00:19:40,070
Well... What if Yun suddenly dies?

185
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:41,010
- Mom!
- Mom!

186
00:19:41,010 --> 00:19:43,580
Celebrity gossip is crazy.

187
00:19:43,580 --> 00:19:46,980
And you're not even Yun's wife.

188
00:19:46,980 --> 00:19:51,030
What if bad rumors start?
Then no one will want to marry you.

189
00:19:51,030 --> 00:19:52,460
- Mom!
- Mom!

190
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:54,900
I'll bring it to him now.

191
00:19:56,170 --> 00:19:57,940
Oh, okay.

192
00:19:59,210 --> 00:20:00,840
Be careful.

193
00:20:03,800 --> 00:20:06,800
Trying having your own kids, brats!

194
00:20:06,800 --> 00:20:08,540
Stop staring!

195
00:20:08,540 --> 00:20:12,670
How dare you stare at your mother like that!

196
00:20:12,670 --> 00:20:14,710
Maybe you're right.

197
00:20:14,710 --> 00:20:20,300
Look at Yun's mom.
She looked down on Eunchae when Yun was doing well.

198
00:20:20,300 --> 00:20:24,010
And now that she needs her...

199
00:20:24,010 --> 00:20:26,950
She's like, "Eunchae! Eunchae!"

200
00:20:26,950 --> 00:20:28,970
"Eunchae!"

201
00:20:28,970 --> 00:20:31,450
Is Eunchae the community service leader
in this town or something?

202
00:20:31,450 --> 00:20:32,610
That's what I'm saying.

203
00:20:32,610 --> 00:20:34,580
Yeah, right.

204
00:20:34,580 --> 00:20:38,740
You two were more interested in
making Yun a part of the family!

205
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:43,180
"I can't wait to tell them that
Choi Yun will be my son-in-law!

206
00:20:43,180 --> 00:20:46,630
Everyone will die from jealousy!"

207
00:20:47,530 --> 00:20:49,080
When did I say that?

208
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:54,500
"Choi Yun will be my brother-in-law!
They will all be so jealous!"

209
00:20:54,500 --> 00:20:56,650
I said that? When?

210
00:20:56,650 --> 00:20:59,690
You two are so fair-weathered.

211
00:20:59,690 --> 00:21:01,970
You switch sides on a whim.

212
00:21:01,970 --> 00:21:05,240
I'm starting to feel disillusioned, really.

213
00:21:06,130 --> 00:21:07,500
- I know.
- I know.

214
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:14,550
I'm outside to get some fresh air.
Yeah. Yun is asleep.

215
00:21:14,550 --> 00:21:18,780
I've sent some Ogalpi tea and
mushroom honey with Eunchae.

216
00:21:18,780 --> 00:21:21,710
Give it to him regularly, even if he doesn't like it.

217
00:21:21,710 --> 00:21:25,660
Thank you. How can I repay you?

218
00:21:25,660 --> 00:21:28,440
You don't owe me anything. We are friends.

219
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:32,030
When Yun gets healthy let's become in-laws!

220
00:21:32,030 --> 00:21:35,340
Okay. Future in-law.

221
00:21:39,570 --> 00:21:43,700
I think Eunchae's car is pulling in.
Yeah, future in-law.

222
00:21:43,700 --> 00:21:46,610
Wait, Yun is calling.

223
00:21:46,610 --> 00:21:48,810
I'll call you later, okay?

224
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:54,250
Yun. Are you awake, son?

225
00:21:54,250 --> 00:21:56,760
Yeah, it's Mom. I'm coming inside.

226
00:22:09,730 --> 00:22:11,010
Blockhead.

227
00:22:13,100 --> 00:22:14,520
Let's date.

228
00:22:16,060 --> 00:22:20,230
You said you would do anything. Did you forget already?

229
00:22:22,330 --> 00:22:25,890
Should we take my car or your car?

230
00:22:36,830 --> 00:22:43,170
Eunchae's Mom had Eunchae bring
Ogalpi tea and honey for you.

231
00:22:44,510 --> 00:22:48,010
Is Eunchae coming right now?

232
00:22:48,010 --> 00:22:54,100
Yeah I saw her parking the car.
She should be coming in.

233
00:22:57,160 --> 00:23:03,130
I talked to Eunchae's mom about
you and Eunchae getting married.

234
00:23:04,550 --> 00:23:05,650
Huh?

235
00:23:08,190 --> 00:23:11,050
We agree that it's a good idea.

236
00:23:11,050 --> 00:23:14,620
So get well soon, okay?

237
00:23:21,190 --> 00:23:22,960
Are you that happy?

238
00:23:26,470 --> 00:23:29,590
Don't laugh. You'll just strain yourself!

239
00:23:29,590 --> 00:23:31,830
Don't laugh.

240
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:43,950
Afraid?

241
00:23:46,380 --> 00:23:47,920
Scared, right?

242
00:23:49,290 --> 00:23:53,720
Let me know if you're not up to it.
We can always call off the promise.

243
00:23:55,060 --> 00:23:56,890
You wish I would say that, right?

244
00:23:57,940 --> 00:24:04,750
I don't don't do take-backs.
I don't have that kind of time.

245
00:24:04,750 --> 00:24:06,590
- Are you on drugs?
- Yep.

246
00:24:09,540 --> 00:24:11,610
- Did you get shot in the head?
- Yep.

247
00:24:14,810 --> 00:24:16,500
How did you know that?

248
00:24:18,940 --> 00:24:21,760
Fine. Do as you wish, Mister.

249
00:24:21,760 --> 00:24:24,840
I wanted to give my own heart to Yun,

250
00:24:24,840 --> 00:24:27,800
but since you want to volunteer, I'm thankful.

251
00:24:29,120 --> 00:24:31,660
How can I ever repay you for this?

252
00:24:31,660 --> 00:24:35,840
Tell me if you want anything. I'll give you anything.

253
00:24:35,840 --> 00:24:40,610
Just tell me. I'll give you the works.

254
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:56,970
It was Eunchae and Eunchae's car for sure.

255
00:24:56,970 --> 00:24:59,370
Try calling her cell.

256
00:25:00,790 --> 00:25:01,990
Mom.

257
00:25:01,990 --> 00:25:03,540
Yes, son?

258
00:25:04,160 --> 00:25:06,570
Am I too selfish?

259
00:25:06,570 --> 00:25:07,510
Huh?

260
00:25:07,510 --> 00:25:10,040
Eunchae doesn't even want to...

261
