00:57:35,600 --> 00:57:38,980
[Their unwavering love is setting an example for many]

526
00:57:38,980 --> 00:57:41,600
Oh! Eunchae!

527
00:57:41,600 --> 00:57:43,150
It's Eunchae!

528
00:58:29,070 --> 00:58:33,250
I'll tell him I had to do it to save him.

529
00:58:33,980 --> 00:58:36,940
Because I made a deal. That I had no choice.

530
00:58:36,940 --> 00:58:39,230
Yun will understand.

531
00:58:56,792 --> 00:58:58,625
[Episode 12 Preview]

532
00:58:58,625 --> 00:59:01,561
Should I just forgive her?

533
00:59:01,561 --> 00:59:06,171
That pretty lady.
Should we forgive her?

534
00:59:09,594 --> 00:59:12,378
[Sorry, I too want to forgive]

535
00:59:12,378 --> 00:59:15,082
What can you do for Eunchae?

536
00:59:15,082 --> 00:59:22,162
If it were me, if I thought I couldn't do
anything for the girl I loved,

537
00:59:22,210 --> 00:59:25,074
I would give her up.

538
00:59:29,930 --> 00:59:31,294
[Love, disappear from my life now]

539
00:59:31,294 --> 00:59:34,397
Don't come here again. Get lost, Mister.

540
00:59:34,397 --> 00:59:38,817
Please get out of my life.
